OL,3,GNEWSATrains delayed after signalling
OL,4,Acables are stolen
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services to London from Norfolk,
OL,7,FSuffolk and Essex are facing delays due
OL,8,Fto the suspected theft of signalling
OL,9,Fcables.
OL,11,FThe equipment was reportedly snatched
OL,12,Fnear Beaulieu Park station in
OL,13,FChelmsford in the early hours of
OL,14,FSunday.
OL,16,F"Services are having to run at a much
OL,17,Freduced speed through the area, on all
OL,18,Flines, leading to delays and
OL,19,Fcongestion," the train operator posted
OL,20,Fon X.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
