OL,3,GNEWSATrains delayed after signalling
OL,4,Acables are stolen
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngineers from Network Rail have been
OL,7,Finvestigating the issue on-site and
OL,8,Fwarned delays would continue until at
OL,9,Fleast 15:00 BST.
